- **AppDialog and useAppDialog**: `shared/layout-components/modal/AppDialog.tsx`, `shared/hooks/useAppDialog.ts`
- **Upsert Modal (scrollbar + resizable with AppDialog/useAppDialog)**: See `app/[locale]/app/customers/[customerId]/UpsertContactModal.tsx`
